# Line-ending policy: the repository stores every text file with LF endings.
#
# `text=auto` lets Git tell text from binary and normalise text to LF on commit, whatever each
# contributor has `core.autocrlf` set to. A Windows checkout may still show CRLF in its working copy;
# what is stored, and what readers and tools fetch, is LF.
* text=auto
*.md text
LICENSE text
